WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.833
- The most storied division in sports, and it’s ours. 
What could go wrong?

00:00:03.958 --> 00:00:05.500
- WHOOPS, WE EXTENDED THE WRONG GUY.

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:08.250
- Now it’s ours for the taking. What could go wrong?

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:09.833
Oh no, did I ruin the tank?

00:00:10.166 --> 00:00:11.958
- JUST WIN EIGHT GAMES. YOU DON’T KNOW HOW GOOD YOU HAVE IT.

00:00:14.916 --> 00:00:17.250
- Got a clear path. What could go wrong?

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.208
- [Announcer:] Three-yard gain.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.416
[Announcer:] Three-yard gain.

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:20.416
- Grab it, boys!

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.291
- Hey, it’s just me, Josh McCown, left. I think I’m your punter now?

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:26.041
- [TOGETHER:] I SHOULD LOSE TO THE NINERS IN THE WILD CARD. 

00:00:26.583 --> 00:00:27.000
- I’M OPEN.

00:00:27.166 --> 00:00:28.125
- I’M NOT OPEN.

00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:29.125
- ZACH, CATCH.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.708
- No. 1 offense in every metric but points. What could go—

00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:33.000
- Uh, let’s settle for that.

00:00:33.041 --> 00:00:34.000
- JASON, NO.

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:38.666
- Hey, Lincoln Riley, I’ll give you a billion dollars to say yes to me for 10 years.

00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:41.416
HEY, DAK, HE SAID HE JUST HAS TO LOSE TO LSU FIRST. HA HA!

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.541
- We need help, and I know just the guy.

00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:45.708
- SANTA?! KILL HIM WITH BATTERIES!

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.375
- FRANK REICH! Thank God!

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.500
- [Eli Manning:] DID SOMEBODY SAY SPOILER?!

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:51.500
- GO FOR IT!

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:52.916
- UH, WHAT HE SAID, YES. GO FOR IT!

00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:55.500
- Great job, everyone.

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:57.291
- [Aaron Donald:] I can't believe we lost to one of them.

00:00:57.416 --> 00:00:59.833
- They can’t all be great rivalries like us, Tom!

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:04.333
&nbsp;- If you want the NFC East to be good again,

00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:07.166
Please subscribe below so the NFL will rename the LA RAMS... 

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:08.291
TO THE DELAWARE CLAMS.

00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:09.708
OH DELAWARE, 

00:01:09.708 --> 00:01:11.208
WE RAISE OUR CUP

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:13.875
FROM OUR SANDY BEACH CHAIR

00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:16.791
WE PROUDLY YELL TO OUR FOES

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.375
One two three… CLAM UP!

